# Frontend

Behavior: `docs/dashboard.md`. Poll 10–15s. No WebSockets. No Next.js BFF that reimplements Nest.

- Rewrite `/api/v1` to the API. Access JWT in memory; refresh cookie httpOnly.
- Hide buttons by role; **never** treat UI as authorization.
- Clean and professional; do not gold-plate CSS.
